{
	[1]={ model="6104", name="Clawed Clerk", english="Kalan Lisa", story="Mutants commonly found around fortress cities—The remnants of business suits, neckties, and leather shoes still visible on their twisted forms tell their tragic origin—these were once white-collar workers toiling in cubicles. Perhaps moments before contamination, they had just closed a deal, finalized a proposal, received a promotion... or were rushing home to loved ones... Until the unknown catastrophe struck, ending everything in an instant.", hero_type=1, shadow="mon_archives_normal_6104.png", shadow_unlock="mon_archives_shadow_6104.png", dangerous=1, skill_list={298380,300086,3001}, type=3, special="Focus Front Row", speed="", element={0}, weak_point={0,3}
},
	[2]={ model="6109", name="Hammer Man", english="DAVIST", story="Originally workers from the mining facilities, these individuals underwent grotesque transformation after exposure to the Void Expanse during the Anchor Panic. Their mutated epidermal growths and aberrant biological structures indicate Stage III infection. Though clumsy in movement, they retain terrifying proficiency with mining hammers—a grim reminder of their former profession. Unprepared travelers are strongly advised to disengage.", hero_type=5, shadow="mon_archives_normal_6109.png", shadow_unlock="mon_archives_shadow_6109.png", dangerous=2, skill_list={298780,300483,300486,3004,300401}, type=3, special="Focus Front Row", speed="", element={0}, weak_point={0,5}
